WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 3.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:03.900
Bill C-18.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.100
The Online News Act.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.200
It was sold as a lifeline for journalism.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:15.600
The result: Meta blocked news for 40 million Canadians, and the oligopoly took the funds.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.975
Small independent publishers were devastated.
